{"id":"wb-5-377","name":"己略黄公祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"己略黄公祠","text":"己略黄公祠位于广东省潮州市湘桥区义安路铁巷2号。2001年6月25日，中国国务院列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n1887年，即清光绪十三年建成，为黄己略私家祠堂。里面“雕梁画栋”，具备潮州木雕、潮州石雕等艺术特征，其不同于一般私家祠堂采用八宝四艺、八吉祥、文房四宝等传统吉祥图案，己略黄公祠运用历史典故、人物及传说做为金漆木雕题材，其中包括将相和、洛神、三顾茅庐、完璧归赵等，极具历史及艺术价值。现为一座二进院落。天井立头进与后厅之中，廊轩居两侧，抱厦驻后厅，格局为四厅相向。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%B1%E7%95%A5%E9%BB%84%E5%85%AC%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":94089275,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94089275","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/27db2461ef5fb7ef4c3f192e.jpg","title":"Chaozhou_Jiluehuanggong_Ci_2013.10.26_16-14-20.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chaozhou_Jiluehuanggong_Ci_2013.10.26_16-14-20.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Chaozhou_Jiluehuanggong_Ci_2013.10.26_16-14-20.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"潮州已略黄公祠","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}